{'symbol': 'ULTA', 'date': '2019-12-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'ULTA BEAUTY, INC. REVISES EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2019; TO OPEN APPROXIMATELY 80 NEW STORES', 'text': 'ULTA BEAUTY, INC. REVISED EARNINGS GUIDANCE FOR THE FISCAL YEAR 2019. FOR THE YEAR, THE COMPANY EXPECTED INCREASE OF TOTAL SALES BY APPROXIMATELY 10% (PREVIOUSLY BETWEEN 9% AND 12%). THE COMPANY EXPECTED TO DELIVER DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE IN THE RANGE OF $11.93 TO $12.03 (PREVIOUSLY $11.86 TO $12.06).THE COMPANY EXPECTED TO OPEN APPROXIMATELY 80 NEW STORES, EXECUTE APPROXIMATELY 20 REMODEL OR RELOCATION PROJECTS, AND COMPLETE APPROXIMATELY 270 STORE REFRESHES.'}